p2sql_query_rewriter.py is RQ4/langshield-langchain/langshield/sql_query_rewriter.py from the
artifact of R. Pedro, M. Coimbra, D. Castro, P. Carreira and N. Santos, "Prompt-to-SQL injections
in LLM-integrated web applications: Risks and defenses" (ICSE 2025), https://zenodo.org/records/14743615
